AIXM 5.1 business rules (SBVR) and the Donlon / Digital NOTAM sample data
are published by EUROCONTROL and the US FAA at https://aixm.aero and remain
subject to their own copyright and terms. The Donlon sample data (a fictitious State) are also built into
AIXM-Code-Converter.html ("Try it with sample data") and shipped in the samples folder of the release; their
notice and licence are kept in the files and in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt.
The AMXM 2.0.2 XML schema (aerodrome mapping exchange model, code lists and
definitions) is Copyright RTCA and EUROCAE and is used under its BSD-style
licence; RTCA and EUROCAE do not endorse this product.

